{"qid": "mt_00033_t3", "category": "multi-turn", "bucket": "b4", "method": "legalgate", "seed": 0, "split": "test_e4", "turn_id": 2, "group_id": "g0033", "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": false, "n_retrieval_calls": 0, "latency_ms": 914.52, "n_tokens": 246, "u": 0.6, "tau_b": 1.0, "tau": null, "channel": "A", "gate_source": "complexity", "router_mode": "hybrid", "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": true, "key_recall": 0.2308, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 370, "slots_inherited_ok": 0, "score_detail": "[mt/provision] cited_golden=True key_recall=0.23", "answer": "可以继续引用《劳动合同法》，但需要先纠正我前面的一个错误，避免你被误导。\n\n**一、更正：第八十二条不是加班费条款**\n\n《劳动合同法》第八十二条规定的是**未订立书面劳动合同的二倍工资**，与加班费无关。我前面把它当作加班费依据引用，是错误的，请勿采用。\n\n**二、加班费的正确法律依据**\n\n- 《劳动法》第四十四条：安排延长工作时间的，支付不低于工资的150%；休息日安排工作又不能安排补休的，支付不低于200%；法定休假日安排工作的，支付不低于300%。\n- 《劳动合同法》第八十五条：用人单位安排加班不支付加班费的，由劳动行政部门责令限期支付；逾期不支付的，责令按应付金额50%以上100%以下的标准向劳动者加付赔偿金。\n\n**三、关于举证责任**\n\n《最高人民法院关于审理劳动争议案件适用法律问题的解释（一）》第四十二条：劳动者", "trace": {"channel": "A", "u": 0.6, "u_signal": 0.178074, "u_complexity": 0.6, "gate_source": "complexity", "router_mode": "hybrid", "complexity_features": {"long": 0.3, "case_word": 0.0, "topic": 0.2, "multi_turn": 0.1, "compare": 0.0, "boilerplate_penalty": -0.0, "category_prior": 0.0}, "tau_b": 1.0, "bucket": "b4", "slots": {"law_short": "劳动合同法", "article_no": null, "paragraph_no": null, "item_no": null, "case_no_raw": null, "topic": "劳动争议", "temporal_query": false, "law_validity_query": false, "provision_seeking": false, "inherited": []}, "slots_inherited": [], "validity_status": null, "case_verify": null, "source_url": null, "decision": "[complexity] u=0.6000 <= tau_b4=1.0 → A", "latency_ms": 914.4, "n_retrieval_calls": 0, "signal": "margin", "k_draft": 20, "intent": {"hit_provision": false, "hit_case_no": false, "slots_complete": false, "route_b_reason": "", "slots": {"law_short": "劳动合同法", "article_no": null, "paragraph_no": null, "item_no": null, "case_no_raw": null, "topic": "劳动争议", "temporal_query": false, "law_validity_query": false, "provision_seeking": false, "inherited": []}}, "retrieval": null, "llm_backend": "deepseek", "draft_source": "local", "draft_attempts": [{"source": "local", "ok": true, "seconds": 0.912, "note": "本机草稿模型 E:/ModelCache/huggingface/hub/models--Qwen--Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct/snapshots\\7ae557604adf67be50417f59c2c2f167def9a775"}], "draft_seconds": 7.592, "draft_text": "根据《中华人民共和国劳动合同法》第八十二条的规定，《劳动合同法》可以继续引用。"}}
